  "rationale": "The batch includes noun continuations after an adjective (notably day after sunny) that the existing day rule, which requires a preceding determiner, does not cover. It also includes a noun after the opening token The and proper-name continuations after with. These small output-root additions support those visible-prefix patterns without asserting a fixed story opening or a specific name after with. Other nouns and continuations remain possible; the exact The-to-pears rule is based on limited evidence and could overfavor pears in that narrow context, so its weight is restrained. The proposed changes have not passed the replay gate.",
